WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.710
escapes your mind and
enters the physical world.

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:05.450
Night terrors are
different from nightmares.

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:07.830
You're not just dreaming anymore.

00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:11.410
You're acting out the dream
while still completely asleep.

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:15.930
You might sit up in bed, eyes
wide open, but seeing nothing.

00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:19.830
You might scream, thrash,
run across the room.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:24.860
Your heart rate spikes to dangerous
levels, sometimes over 160

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:29.810
beats per minute. You're drenched
in sweat, gasping for air.

